# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Flow: Grom'gol -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar (training at 40, riding) -> Freewind Post -> Tanaris
# (Gadgetzan, the Noonshade Ruins, Steamwheedle Port and Lost Rigger Cove, the Waterspring Field)
# -> fly to Brackenwall Village -> Dustwallow Marsh (Mok'Morokk's chain, the Dragonmurk, Onyxia's
# eggs) -> fly to Freewind Post -> Feralas (Camp Mojache, the Gordunni, Woodpaw, the Grimtotem,
# the Writhing Deep, the yetis, the screechers) -> fly to Orgrimmar.
#
# Accepted here, finished later on the route: Steamwheedle Port's Lost Rigger Cove quests
# (8365, 8366, 2873, 2875) and Screecher Spirits (3520) go back to the port at 47.

step Zeppelin to Orgrimmar
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  goto 31.4,29.9 "Zeppelin to Orgrimmar"

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  goto 51.5,45.6 "Orgrimmar"

step Orgrimmar
  only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  zone Orgrimmar
  train class only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  accept 3631 only Warlock              -- Zevrost, Cleft of Shadow

step Riding at 40
  only Orc,Skyborne
  zone Orgrimmar
  when level>=40
  tip Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Kildar teaches Orcs in the Valley of Honor, by Ogunaro Wolfrunner's kennel. Skyborne learn it from Genn Fairweather at the Fairweather Stables in Valanaar on Zephras Isle, with a Galestrider: the skyboat to the isle leaves the cliffs south of Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff, about every five minutes. Your race's other mounts are 20 gold each: Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 has a guide for each.
  train 4752 only Orc optional          -- Kildar, riding trainer
  note "Wolves: Ogunaro Wolfrunner, beside Kildar." only Orc
  note "Riding and Galestriders: Genn Fairweather, at the Fairweather Stables in Valanaar on Zephras Isle." only Skyborne

step Belgrom Rockmaul
  zone Orgrimmar
  accept 2981

step Riding at 40
  only Troll
  zone Durotar
  when level>=40
  tip Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Xar'Ti in Sen'jin Village, a short ride south of Orgrimmar down the Durotar road, with Zjolnir's raptors (20 gold each) beside him. Ride back to Orgrimmar's flight master afterwards.
  train 7953 optional                   -- Xar'Ti, riding trainer
  note "Raptors: Zjolnir, beside Xar'Ti in Sen'jin Village."

