step Waterspring Field: kill these as you meet them
  zone Tanaris
  tip The shadow mages, rogues and assassins camp south-east of Gadgetzan.
  tip South-east of Gadgetzan the Wastewander bandits camp in the dunes; Caliph stands in the eastern camp.
  tip Careful: Wastewander Rogues keep Sneak up while out of combat, so hidden rogues can join a fight you start at a camp.
  tip Careful: Two stealthed Wastewander Rogues travel with him wherever he goes. At his spawn camp, two shadowmages and their minions are close enough to join a fight with him. Out by the towers you can fight him without them.
  kill 5617 quest 1691.3
  kill 5623 quest 1691.2
  kill 5615 quest 1691.1
  collect 8723 quest 2781.1 @61.8,38.2

