step The Dragonmurk: kill these as you meet them
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip East through the Wyrmbog: the Firemane scouts and ash tails roam its northern edge with the Searing hatchlings and whelps; the scalebanes guard the dragon caves further south-east. Mok'Morokk's snuff, grog and strongbox lie in the dragonkin camps.
  kill 4331 quest 1168.2
  kill 4328 quest 1168.3
  kill 4329 quest 1168.1              -- Firemane Scout walks around The Dragonmurk: look inside the circle on the map
