step Feralas: kill these as you meet them
  zone Feralas
  tip The sprite darters flit over the grove just west of Mojache; nearly every one drops a wing. The Woodpaw alphas lead the camps south-west of it: kill them within the hour.
  tip Careful: Most Alphas sit in small tent camps with 2-4 other gnolls that join the fight, and other gnolls patrol between the camps.
